Subject: [PATCH 1/2] seo: noindex login/offline and add exam-night load test

/login and /offline get a robots noindex meta (not a robots.txt Disallow,
so crawlers can still see the noindex). Adds a k6 script that load-tests
the anonymous public routes and /api/v1/health without sending OTP SMS.

